WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.768
Welcome to Cursor Community Welcome — a configurable animated welcome screen for workshops and events.

2
00:00:06.768 --> 00:00:15.672
The landing stage opens with the Cursor logo, chapter brand, word-by-word heading, live date, and a floating particle backdrop.

3
00:00:15.672 --> 00:00:23.712
Top-right controls let organizers edit content, enter presentation preview, or share a link with the current configuration.

4
00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:35.568
The sidebar editor customizes brand, title, auto or fixed date, a five-to-sixty-second replay interval, and up to five sponsors — or reset to defaults without touching code.

5
00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:46.224
Keyboard shortcuts keep presentation smooth — press E to open the editor, F or P for fullscreen preview, and Escape to close the sidebar or exit fullscreen.

6
00:00:46.224 --> 00:00:58.752
A shareable URL encodes the full configuration — custom brand, heading, a fixed event date instead of today, replay interval, and sponsor chips — then saves it to local storage.

7
00:00:58.752 --> 00:01:06.816
Settings persist in local storage and restore on the next visit, with sponsor chips showing a title and name for each partner.

8
00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:12.312
Share copies that configuration link so teammates open the same welcome screen instantly.

9
00:01:12.312 --> 00:01:18.816
Preview enters presentation mode so the welcome animation fills the screen without editor chrome.

10
00:01:18.816 --> 00:01:26.112
The footer credits the crafter in India and links back to Cursor — a polished close for every community session.
